S235: medianized route-center gate for LRC14
================================================================================
1. SIMPLEX / BRIDGE / FAULHABER U TABLE
   n  n(n+1)  T_n  directed_simplex_edges  K_{n,n+1}_lines  rank_2n  rectangle_debt
   1       2    1                       2                 2        2               0
   2       6    3                       6                 6        4               2
   3      12    6                      12                12        6               6
   4      20   10                      20                20        8              12
   5      30   15                      30                30       10              20
   6      42   21                      42                42       12              30
   7      56   28                      56                56       14              42

   reading:
     n(n+1)=2*T_n is the directed edge count of the n-simplex 1-skeleton,
     the line count of the K_{n,n+1} diagonal bridge, and the old
     Faulhaber odd-moment carrier u=n(n+1).
     The bridge has rank 2n; the remaining n(n-1) is rectangle debt.

